1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,460
Y'all see what's going on, and right now is a very critical time.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:07,500
We need to understand the reality of voting, not just the action behind it.

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,280
We are not voting for a person.

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,660
We're voting for a path forward.

5
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:17,240
We vote because there are real issues that are facing you, your community, your kids, etc.

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:21,400
You want to vote the best person for the path forward to dealing with those issues.

7
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:25,660
And I have partnered with the Black Futures Lab to spread the word about the Black Census.

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,880
Largest survey of Black people in America since the Reconstruction.

9
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:33,120
They want to know what are the voting issues that you care about.

10
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,420
And what is your experience like in this country as a Black person?

11
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,960
Because our issues matter even outside of an election year.

12
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:43,780
Please visit the link in my bio so that you can complete the census.

13
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,540
You have until October 15th.

14
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,220
Okay.

15
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:48,820
Please vote.

16
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,340
For a number of reasons.

17
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,240
You know, vote just to be petty.

18
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:55,400
Because the 14th Amendment said you a citizen and you should be able to vote.

19
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,320
And they have spent all of this effort trying to make sure that you don't vote,

20
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,360
even though they said you were supposed to be able to.

21
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,040
Vote because, baby, if your vote didn't matter,

22
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:06,600
they would not put all of this work in to suppress it.

23
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:10,540
The reality is we are not going to solve America in this next election.

24
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:17,440
But I believe we can vote for the best path forward to give us the time to attempt to do so.

25
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:22,100
We know that our voices need to be heard and the Black Census wants to hear from you.

26
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:25,800
So go to my link in bio before October 15th and fill it out.

